The next formula is presented without an assumed named law (1035). [let series]
\begin{equation}q_{1235}\end{equation}

Current enters the positive-voltage terminal, yet the sheet asserts $V=-IR$.

The next formula is presented without an assumed named law (1043). [define as]
\begin{equation}q_{1243}\end{equation}

The regression reports merely $V\approx IR$ over the sampled range.

